1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,380
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,604
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,123
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,123 --> 00:00:59,553
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 17=

12
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,000
(Wedding)
The auspicious hour has come.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,120
Please welcome the officiant.

14
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,799
Say it again.

15
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,359
Please welcome the officiant.

16
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:28,799
What's going on with Ye?

17
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:31,200
Did he oversleep because he's so old?

18
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:32,519
That's it.

19
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,040
I'll check on him.

20
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,040
Hey, wait!

21
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:34,599
Wait!

22
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,560
Princess Consort,

23
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,359
a bride can't lift her veil early.

24
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,040
It's bad luck.

25
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,519
Whatever my princess consort wants to do

26
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,000
is my good fortune.

27
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,719
Go on.

28
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,359
Ye, where the hell have you been?

29
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:58,640
Missing on a day this important.
Next time I'm docking your wages.

30
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,879
Something's happened to Ye.

31
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:17,960
Don't panic.

32
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:20,240
That's not necessarily Ye's blood.

33
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,599
No. I have to look for him.

34
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,000
Pei Chen, Qian Ning,

35
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,319
gather everyone. Search everywhere.

36
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,080
Understood.

37
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,240
It's all right.

38
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,080
Don't worry.

39
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,439
Ye will be fine.

40
00:02:38,989 --> 00:02:40,360
(Crazy Good Noodle House)

41
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,159
Ye!

42
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,039
Where on earth did he go?

43
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,560
(Good afternoon, Host.)

44
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:55,280
(The Space System upgrade is complete.)

45
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:59,439
So you weren't broken before.

46
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:00,879
You were upgrading.

47
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,319
(Apologies for the wait, Host.)

48
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:04,840
(I present the welcome-back gift pack.)

49
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,080
(Claim)
Please tap to claim.

50
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,240
(100 points received.)

51
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,400
That's more like it.

52
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,240
Where could Ye possibly be?

53
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,360
He's at Xingyun Sect.

54
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,520
You... You're the man from that day.

55
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,919
(Pavilion Master.)

56
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,719
How do you know about Ye?

57
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,400
Pavilion Master,

58
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,879
before your wedding,

59
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:36,280
a man from Xingyun Sect
entered his room.

60
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,960
Then he was taken away.

61
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:47,360
It's the pattern on Ye's thumb ring.

62
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:48,759
How do you know that?

63
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:49,680
Pavilion Master,

64
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,639
I've been close by you all along.

65
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,919
I knew you couldn't acknowledge me yet,

66
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,240
so I stayed hidden.

67
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:56,960
Someone's coming.

68
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,800
I'll take my leave.

69
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:01,879
Hey, wait. What Pavilion Master?

70
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:02,840
What's that about?

71
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,960
Princess Consort, did you find him?

72
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:09,120
Qian Ning, I need to go to Xingyun Sect.

73
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,000
What?

74
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,560
You're going to Xingyun Sect?

75
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:12,639
You can't, Princess Consort.

76
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,280
Why not?

77
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,240
You might not know this,

78
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,839
but a few days ago
when His Highness returned,

79
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,040
he happened to mention

80
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,600
that after the Grand Princess affair,

81
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,600
His Majesty is very wary
of recruiting martial sects.

82
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,360
He won't let anyone get involved
anymore.

83
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,639
If you go now as the princess consort,

84
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,000
people will talk.

85
00:04:28,279 --> 00:04:29,879
Let's just go back to the mansion.

86
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:30,959
Alas.

87
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,880
(Prince Rong's Mansion)

88
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,639
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

89
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:41,720
Did you find him?

90
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:43,560
We searched the city for half a day

91
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,439
and found nothing.

92
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:45,920
But, Your Highness,

93
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,240
we have a new theory.

94
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,079
Go on.

95
00:04:49,639 --> 00:04:50,399
The shadow guards report

96
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,160
that today, in Prince Rong's Mansion,

97
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,199
someone from Xingyun Sect slipped in.

98
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:58,600
Xingyun Sect is holding
its Sect Master succession contest soon.

99
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,439
My guess is

100
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:01,800
that Ye

101
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,079
went with that person.

102
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,399
That's right, Your Highness.

103
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:06,600
We don't know where the princess consort
got her information,

104
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,319
but just now at the noodle house,

105
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,519
she suddenly got the idea
to go to Xingyun Sect.

106
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,879
It must be

107
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:14,040
connected to Ye.

108
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:17,079
A mere sect succession contest,

109
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:19,360
and Ye rushes off like this,

110
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,959
leaving without a word
to preside over it.

111
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:22,639
The scouts also report

112
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,439
that the Yuanding Realm

113
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:26,399
has already sent agents
into Xingyun Sect.

114
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,360
So

115
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,439
whether Ye went back
to preside over the Xingyun Sect contest

116
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:37,040
or to meet someone in haste,

117
00:05:37,879 --> 00:05:39,199
we can't tell yet.

118
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:43,639
You two, go to
the Yuanding Realm in the next few days

119
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:46,759
and find out who's behind it.

120
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:51,839
Until you know,

121
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,319
keep it quiet.

122
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,480
(I wonder if going to Xingyun Sect
behind Mo Yuya's back)

123
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,560
(will cause trouble for him.)

124
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,279
(But it probably won't, right?)

125
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,720
(After all, we never
finished the wedding ceremony.)

126
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,240
What... what kind of darn weather
is that?

127
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,000
Don't be scared.

128
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,360
The weather in these woods
is unpredictable,

129
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,920
but this is dry thunder.

130
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,399
It won't rain.

131
00:06:47,879 --> 00:06:49,040
Mo Yuya.

132
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,959
How come I never knew

133
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,319
that you're terrified of thunder,
my dear?

134
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,800
I...

135
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,279
I didn't know enough to be afraid.

136
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,439
What are you doing here?

137
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,199
I couldn't let you go alone, naturally.

138
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:07,759
Fine.

139
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,360
I know where you're going.

140
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,839
You want to go to Xingyun Sect.

141
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,680
I'm coming with you.

142
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,800
You mean

143
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:24,600
you're going to investigate
Yuanding's spies in Xingyun Sect?

144
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:28,040
With His Majesty's decree,
on official business?

145
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:30,439
What did you think?

146
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,360
Did you think I'd sneak around

147
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,199
like you, acting like some thief
in the night?

148
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:37,000
I was only trying not to drag you
into it.

149
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,560
Husband and wife share one fate.

150
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:40,800
From now on, your troubles are mine.

151
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,120
Don't think of it as dragging me down.

152
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,160
And don't ever leave
without a word again.

153
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:49,000
We haven't even
finished the ceremony yet.

154
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:52,519
We will sooner or later.
You can't run from it.

155
00:07:53,916 --> 00:07:57,750
(Xingyun Sect)

156
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:11,000
Mo Yuya.

157
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,120
We've searched every cell, cellar,
and woodshed here,

158
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,240
and there's no sign of Ye.

159
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,160
Where could he have gone?

160
00:08:19,839 --> 00:08:20,879
Maybe

161
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,600
Ye

162
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,680
was never hidden at all.

163
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,040
What do you mean?

164
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:29,000
You found something?

165
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:40,840
You mean Ye is being held and questioned
in the Sect Master's courtyard?

166
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,279
Ye, a prisoner of that caliber?

167
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:45,960
He's not important enough.

168
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,559
Let's go take a look.

169
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,039
I... I won't allow it!

170
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,840
You're the daughter
of the Xingyun Sect Master now.

171
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,000
Think of your station.

172
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,759
And now you want to go back
to being someone's shadow guard?

173
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,039
I don't care.

174
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:08,519
You're my daughter,

175
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,559
and if I say no,

176
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,919
you're not going anywhere.

177
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:14,960
(Lu Ningyan)
Haha.

178
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,159
What's so funny?

179
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,799
I'm laughing at someone

180
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,360
who's gotten addicted to playing a part.

181
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:29,960
You actually think
you can decide my life,

182
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,879
my deadbeat father?

183
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:36,840
When did Ye become the Sect Master
of Xingyun Sect?

184
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,279
And he has such a beautiful daughter?

185
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:44,720
Am I really your precious daughter?

186
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:47,240
Then why was I abandoned as a child,

187
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,480
left in a mass grave
piled high with bodies?

188
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,159
If I hadn't clung to life,

189
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,559
used the last of my strength

190
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:59,279
to make a sound and be saved
by my master,

191
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:03,799
I'd have been dead long ago.

192
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,559
And I wouldn't be here
playing the devoted daughter,

193
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:07,000
calling you father.

194
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,720
I...

195
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:09,639
Wait, I...

196
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:12,720
Back then, the martial world
was a bloodbath, and I...

197
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:16,080
Alright, I'm sorry. There, satisfied?

198
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,080
One apology and that settles it?

199
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:26,720
Wait. I'm an old man past 50 now.

200
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,240
I just want my daughter by my side,

201
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,279
to live out my days in peace.

202
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:31,600
Is that so wrong?

203
00:10:32,279 --> 00:10:34,039
That's the happiness you want.

204
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,200
Not what I want.

205
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,440
In life I belong to my master.

206
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,480
In death I am my master's ghost.

207
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:43,240
I will belong only to him in this life.

208
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:44,679
You...

209
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,919
That girl is unbelievably stubborn.

210
00:10:50,519 --> 00:10:53,639
She'd rather give up
being the Sect Master's daughter

211
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:55,639
to go be a servant to her master.

212
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:01,240
You can tell
she feels more for him than duty.

213
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:02,559
There's a story there.

214
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,159
Boss?

215
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,159
Hey, Ye!

216
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:20,919
Boss,

217
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,080
what are you doing here?

218
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:24,240
Looking for you, of course!

219
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:24,879
I was worried sick!

220
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:25,600
This is great!

221
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,559
Yay!

222
00:11:28,879 --> 00:11:30,000
Master!

223
00:11:56,799 --> 00:11:57,639
Master.

224
00:11:58,879 --> 00:11:59,639
Mo Yuya!

225
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:01,840
Hey, wait! Boss!

226
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,240
Come with me.

227
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,080
Mo Yuya!

228
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,000
You and I have a lot to catch up on.

229
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,240
Boss! Here, take a seat.

230
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,039
Your Highness.

231
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,759
You may rise.

232
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:13,879
Thank you, Your Highness.

233
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,399
It's been over three years
since you disappeared.

234
00:12:19,879 --> 00:12:23,600
Everyone in Prince Rong's Mansion
thought you were dead.

235
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,399
Since you're alive and well,

236
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,240
why didn't you come back to report?

237
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,639
Forgive me, Your Highness.

238
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,840
Three years ago,
you had me track Gu Nanke.

239
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,639
She found me, and we fought.

240
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,519
It was a brutal fight.

241
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,279
I was badly wounded.

242
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:41,279
The people of Xingyun Sect saved me.

243
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:42,879
I clung to life here,

244
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:44,799
drifting in and out for three years.

245
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:48,000
I only recently woke fully

246
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:49,519
and was reunited with my birth father.

247
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,080
You mean Ye?

248
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,360
Yes.

249
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,399
He's my birth father

250
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:59,200
and the Sect Master of Xingyun Sect.

251
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:00,960
Fate works in odd ways.

252
00:13:01,679 --> 00:13:03,639
Before he returned to Xingyun Sect,

253
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,519
I already knew him.

254
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:09,519
Did you come to Xingyun Sect
looking for him, Your Highness?

255
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,559
No.

256
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:12,440
My spies report

257
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:15,360
that Xingyun Sect is choosing
a new Sect Master,

258
00:13:16,159 --> 00:13:17,399
and Yuanding's people have infiltrated.

259
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:20,720
I'm here by imperial order
to investigate.

260
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,240
Understood.

261
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,440
I will help you investigate.

262
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,000
Your Highness,

263
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:32,360
who was that girl just now?

264
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,600
She's my new wife,

265
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:35,600
Feng Weiyue.

266
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,679
She's the princess consort?

267
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:44,679
Didn't you say you'd never marry?

268
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,480
I said that before

269
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:49,120
only because I was suffering
from a rare poison

270
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:50,240
and didn't have long to live.

271
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,600
Now the poison is gone,

272
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,879
and I've met someone I love.

273
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:57,120
Marrying my beloved

274
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,440
is only natural, isn't it?

275
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:08,240
(Love?)

276
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,879
(I thought you were a man
incapable of love.)

277
00:14:12,759 --> 00:14:13,799
(And I)

278
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:17,360
(would be the only female guard
by your side for life.)

279
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:39,120
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

280
00:14:39,327 --> 00:14:41,640
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

281
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:45,680
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

282
00:14:46,167 --> 00:14:48,487
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

283
00:14:49,473 --> 00:14:52,480
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

284
00:14:53,047 --> 00:14:55,280
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

285
00:14:56,413 --> 00:15:00,893
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

286
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:06,160
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

287
00:15:06,793 --> 00:15:09,480
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

288
00:15:10,654 --> 00:15:13,280
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

289
00:15:13,633 --> 00:15:15,840
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

290
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:20,000
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

291
00:15:20,353 --> 00:15:22,720
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

292
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,640
♪This love remains unchanged♪

293
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:28,160
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

294
00:15:29,893 --> 00:15:32,333
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

295
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:36,400
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

296
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,200
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

297
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:41,100
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

298
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:42,840
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

299
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:46,200
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

300
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:50,520
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

301
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,880
♪I don't regret that vow♪

302
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:56,360
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
